  "notes": "USAGE:\nUsed both for physical reproductions (art replicas, document copies) and digital copies (file duplication). In legal and copyright contexts, {複製|ふくせい}{権|けん} (reproduction rights) is a key concept.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {複製|ふくせい}を{作|つく}る (to make a reproduction)\n- {複製|ふくせい}{品|ひん} (replica, reproduction item)\n- {複製|ふくせい}{権|けん} (reproduction rights)\n- {無断|むだん}{複製|ふくせい} (unauthorized reproduction)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- コピー: copy — more casual, everyday term\n- {模造|もぞう}: imitation — often implies lower quality or intent to deceive\n- {複写|ふくしゃ}: copying, duplication — more technical, used for documents",
